{"reviewId": "404207842_840HAKPti", "review": {"abstract": "造成资源需求的边际上升，而以前在资源品价格处于低位时供给没有得到充分准备，这带来供需边际变化短期内的不平衡，资源约束启动，价格迅速上升，这一点一旦与资本收益率的下降相契合就会发生经济冲击。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "全球面临有效需求不足和货币泛滥，央行为了刺激经济，开启宽松周期，导致实际利率下行，也意味着过去多年对大宗商品产能投资的不足。当流动性泛滥遇上供给约束，具备金融属性和实物属性的大宗商品将迎来牛市", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "4566-4660", "createTime": 1760847240, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "404207842_840HAKPti", "userVid": 404207842, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 404207842, "name": "汀若", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0008-bowpHKRBs6Q6sanDFpQIN10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "汀若", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "深耕经济理财/兼顾文学与历史/多元思维框架", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "一花应心妍", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20240513-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 7, "likes": [{"userVid": 6114176, "name": "Victor_C", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/NqRqr3Zxk3VdBsQicz6zTXejCvSMQg5NYF4Z5yzicrzbQnj5V58L3icox90Uurian0ekWB8VnXZr8VrL9jUfMvC79w/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": ""}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "就是说钱多了，但是大宗商品供给不足，具备金融属性和实物属性的大宗商品